#, xml-text
#~ msgid "Using make-ca with Python3"
#~ msgstr "Usando make-ca com Python3"

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "When <application>Python3</application> was installed in LFS, it included "
#~ "the <application>pip3</application> module with vendored certificates from "
#~ "the <application>Certifi</application> module. That was necessary, but it "
#~ "means that whenever <command>pip3</command> is used it can reference those "
#~ "certificates, primarily when creating a virtual environment or when "
#~ "installing a module with all its wheel dependencies in one go."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Quando <application>Python3</application> foi instalado no LFS, ele incluiu "
#~ "o módulo <application>pip3</application> com certificados vendidos "
#~ "originários do módulo <application>Certifi</application>. Isso era "
#~ "necessário, mas significa que sempre que <command>pip3</command> for usado, "
#~ "ele pode referenciar esses certificados, principalmente ao criar um ambiente"
#~ " virtual ou ao instalar um módulo com todas as dependências wheel dele de "
#~ "uma vez."

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "It is generally considered that the System Administrator should be in charge"
#~ " of which certificates are available. Now that <xref linkend=\"make-ca\"/> "
#~ "and <xref linkend=\"p11-kit\"/> have been installed and <application>make-"
#~ "ca</application> has been configured, it is possible to make "
#~ "<command>pip3</command> use the system certificates."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Geralmente considera-se que o(a) Administrador(a) do Sistema(a) deveria ser "
#~ "responsável por quais certificados estão disponíveis. Agora que <xref "
#~ "linkend=\"make-ca\"/> e <xref linkend=\"p11-kit\"/> foram instalados e "
#~ "<application>make-ca</application> foi configurado, é possível fazer com que"
#~ " <command >pip3</command> use os certificados do sistema."

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The vendored certificates installed in LFS are a snapshot from when the "
#~ "pulled-in version of <application>Certifi</application> was created. If you "
#~ "regularly update the system certificates, the vendored version will become "
#~ "out of date."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Os certificados fornecidos instalados no LFS são um instantâneo de quando a "
#~ "versão extraída do <application>Certifi</application> foi criada. Se você "
#~ "atualizar regularmente os certificados do sistema, [então] a versão "
#~ "fornecida se tornará desatualizada."

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "To use the system certificates in <application>Python3</application>, you "
#~ "should set <envar>_PIP_STANDALONE_CERT</envar> to point to them, e.g for the"
#~ " <application>bash</application> shell:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Para usar os certificados do sistema no <application>Python3</application>, "
#~ "você deveria configurar <envar>_PIP_STANDALONE_CERT</envar> para apontar "
#~ "para eles, por exemplo, para o shell <application>bash</application>:"

#, no-wrap, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "<userinput>export _PIP_STANDALONE_CERT=/etc/pki/tls/certs/ca-"
#~ "bundle.crt</userinput>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<userinput>export _PIP_STANDALONE_CERT=/etc/pki/tls/certs/ca-"
#~ "bundle.crt</userinput>"

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "If you have created virtual environments, for example when testing modules, "
#~ "and those include the <application>Requests</application> and "
#~ "<application>Certifi</application> modules in <filename "
#~ "class=\"directory\">~/.local/lib/python&python3-majorver;/</filename>, then "
#~ "those local modules will be used instead of the system certificates unless "
#~ "you remove the local modules."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Se você tiver criado ambientes virtuais, por exemplo, ao testar módulos, e "
#~ "eles incluem os módulos <application>Requests</application> e "
#~ "<application>Certifi</application> em <filename "
#~ "class=\"directory\">~/.local/lib/python&python3-majorver;/</filename>, então"
#~ " esses módulos locais serão usados em vez dos certificados do sistema, a "
#~ "menos que você remova os módulos locais."

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "To use the system certificates in <application>Python3</application> with "
#~ "the BLFS profiles, add the following variable to your system or personal "
#~ "profiles:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Para usar os certificados do sistema no <application>Python3</application> "
#~ "com os perfis BLFS, adicione a seguinte variável aos teus perfis de sistema "
#~ "ou pessoal:"

#, no-wrap, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "<userinput>mkdir -pv /etc/profile.d &amp;&amp;\n"
#~ "cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/pythoncerts.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
#~ "<literal># Begin /etc/profile.d/pythoncerts.sh\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "export _PIP_STANDALONE_CERT=/etc/pki/tls/certs/ca-bundle.crt\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "# End /etc/profile.d/pythoncerts.sh</literal>\n"
#~ "EOF</userinput>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<userinput>mkdir -pv /etc/profile.d &amp;&amp;\n"
#~ "cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/pythoncerts.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
#~ "<literal># Inicia /etc/profile.d/pythoncerts.sh\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "export _PIP_STANDALONE_CERT=/etc/pki/tls/certs/ca-bundle.crt\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "# Termina /etc/profile.d/pythoncerts.sh</literal>\n"
#~ "EOF</userinput>"

